{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_otter_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_otter_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"造物之心","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_otter_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"79a3cbb7d3ee5767d980b75d53af4194b4c3129274b731de5e768be5f262e767","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"罗德岛本舰\n“鲁特拉工作室”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要睁大眼睛看好哦，可露希尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波SUPER，请从操作台上挑出M-11型源石隔离漆层。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（上面的抗源石涂料起码有十几种，去掉了包装，外形和质地都差不多。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全正确。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"这只是基本能力啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这套热能感应装置里有个组件坏了，咪波SUPER，请在三分钟内修复它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经修复完毕。另外，还检测到有个电子元件附在了基座下面，会影响热能感应的效率，现已取出，装置可以正常使用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真棒！才花了两分钟不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！它会说话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"智能版本当然要加装语音模块嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它刚开口的时候，我也很不适应就是了。不过它即使能说话，好像也不怎么爱说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么是这种粗粗的声线......算了不重要，我和梅尔的审美差距很大哦嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"继续继续。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波SUPER，请重新设置工作室的门禁密码。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经重置，新密码采用了大小写字母、生僻符号、数字等共计五种字符的组合。对了，数字并不是你的生日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇，真厉害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我宣布，应用试验第一阶段，成功！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，咪波全新智能版本的原型机——咪波SUPER，表现如何？是不是比你的人工智能小车要厉害？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"真是聪明的小伙！可是，刚刚这些，Lancet-2和Castle-3它们也能做到哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊松口松口，怎么跟梅尔一样咬人呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波SUPER，先放过她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"性能表现是否超过小车尚待评估，但确实比它们要记仇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"别过来，不许咬了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"梅尔，这次咪波SUPER升级，你花了多长时间？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我看看日程表......已经三个月了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔，可露希尔！你要的“雷神挑衅者熔岩猫魔鬼高性能作业平台”的优化方案我做好了，给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦梅尔。接下来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来的话，我想请假一个月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！工作狂居然也会请假？是身体太累了？或者说......你是在暗示涨薪对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前莱茵生命和罗德岛的工作委托都结束了，日程表现在是清空的状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以想要趁机升级一下咪波。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是一直在抽空升级咪波嘛，为什么突然要专门申请一段时间？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几个月来，服役的咪波又报废了三只，还有几只待维修。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最初代的咪波......只剩下一只了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜呜，可怜的咪波。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然咪波的作业效率已经得到了提升，但遇到特别复杂的环境，或者执行精密度要求比较高的任务时，回收率还是无法保证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果咪波能达到人工智能的高度，它们就可以在完成任务的同时保护好自己了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也来帮忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是不了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么，我们不是刚一起帮艾沃娜成功改造了“正义骑士号”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是依托PRTS进行的客制化，连可露希尔都没有完全掌握小车们的代码与运算逻辑吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不希望对咪波进行客制化，从莱茵生命到罗德岛，它们的所有改造都是我自己做的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有问题我会请教可露希尔的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前就已经给咪波搭载了学习装置，但肯定算不上真正的“智能”，我需要重新做起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我尝试直接对原先的咪波核心进行优化，从而完善它的自律逻辑。哎，效果并不太理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我重写了咪波核心底层的代码......花了很多时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原计划咪波SUPER的原型机应该是五只，可以进行对照实验，但最终才完成了一只。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是！这只咪波SUPER，将是前所未有的！它可以应用于更多样更复杂的场景，爆破、勘探、测绘、侦查、作战以及日常生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更重要的是，它可以完全脱离我的操控，独立完成各种精密作业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它将是全泰拉最厉害的智能机械......个头还小，量产起来也很方便，比可露希尔客制化的小车厉害多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到时候它们将组成一支真正的咪波大军！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波SUPER身上这是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铭牌啊，每一只咪波都有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"问题是，它身上为什么会有这么多块！我看一下，C00-1、B03-4、B12、G70......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是以前那些无法再服役，或者彻底报废的咪波的铭牌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，但那些你不都镶进“大咪波碑”里了吗？你把它们都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"所以咪波SUPER是......“带着兄弟们的希望”，这样的意思吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，刚刚梅尔并没有关闭自己对咪波核心的控制权限吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"这样不能算达到了“智能”哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过两天会进行应用试验的下一阶段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"那我到时候再过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"对了梅尔，下次试验之前，记得调整下咪波SUPER爆破程序的参数哦，这里可是罗德岛本舰，万一咪波SUPER......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得赶紧把今天的数据记录进试验日志里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"梅尔，你有没有在听我说话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了咪波SUPER，你改的门禁新密码是多少啊，我试一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，奇怪，好像不对欸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波SUPER！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波核心控制权限已关闭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波SUPER，接下来请对指定区域的建筑进行检测及隐患排除作业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然了，这里可是罗德岛本舰，你要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨呀，你已经是智能咪波了，这点判断能力肯定是有的哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来只需要等待咪波SUPER完成任务回来就行啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，新的工作委托，已经堆了这么多......看来这次确实耽搁了太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看——唔，为部分干员宿舍加装墙体投影、训练场武器系统的调整升级、本舰无人机群和充能装置的联动方案......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀，工作室里也乱糟糟的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趁这个时间，收拾下操作台吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波——SUPER。建筑检测。隐患排除。建筑检测。隐患排除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"共检测出八处不合理构造，计算量——隐患均已排除，方式为——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还剩下最后一处。"},{"type":"narration","text":"“鲁特拉工作室”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"操作台这下看着整洁多啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全景扫描。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"调取比对数据——启用分析系统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果判定——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该空间建筑面积大于常规，生活或工作用途不明，存在危险器械——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警告，隐患排除，请撤离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，把这几套热能感应装置修好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警告，隐患排除，请撤离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原料又不太够了，看来明天得向采购部提交一批加购订单才行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隐患排除方式为——隐患排除方式为——为——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爆破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像有什么动静......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"梅尔的反应并不算慢。当然，如果她没戴着耳机的话，还能更快一些。真是个坏习惯。\n咪波SUPER的爆破程序已经启动。\n延展式机械臂让梅尔及时按下了防冲击系统的启动按钮，这让咪波SUPER的定向爆破产生了偏差。\n鲁特拉工作室的主要区域并未受到影响，但门口承装工程材料的伸出式平台被击毁了。\n梅尔看着咪波SUPER被埋在了自己爆破炸出的废墟里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这些仪器怎么这么重！幸亏机械臂的充能装置没有受影响，不然都挪不开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波SUPER！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梅尔，怎么回事，好远就听见你工作室的动静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波SUPER......好像损毁得很严重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"这些，都是它干的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"也不能全怪它......早就跟你说不要将宿舍用作工作室，更不要扩建。我看看承重结构有没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，可露希尔，咪波SUPER不会在巡视的其他地方也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚从那边过来，还好还好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"（幸亏留了个心眼，提前在附近加装了局域防冲击装置，呼——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"梅尔，你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"我帮你一起收拾吧。你看，都乱成这样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和那时候好像啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，工作室这个乱糟糟的样子，和那时候好像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜你别吓我啊，怎么开始胡言乱语了呢，我不记得你是那种动不动就回忆的人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是说最开始做咪波的时候......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梅尔的工作室怎么又出问题了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是本月第三回了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要么是计时仪器突然停止运作，要么是冷凝系统故障，这回是......椅子自己弹起来把操作台撞翻了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"总之是些不大不小的故障，让她不得不暂离项目岗位，赶回自己的工作室......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都已经同意她成立一人工作室了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她说是巧合，你就当是巧合吧。这点小心思，连心机都算不上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"能够进入莱茵生命，我超级兴奋。\n不仅是哥伦比亚，放在整个泰拉，那也是研究者眼中的圣地。有设备有项目有厉害的前辈福利待遇还好！\n科学能决定泰拉的未来，是我们的共识。但对于科学，莱茵生命内部，尤其是各个主任之间，各有各的理解，各有各的追求，偏执得很。\n氛围变得很奇怪，明明都是很厉害的研究者，但聚在一起效率却莫名地低。就像一支全明星组成的球队，总是打不赢比赛。\n我在的工程科，主要为其他科室提供技术支持。上个月由能量科牵头的项目，筹备到一半，由于总辖反对，这个月就可能中止或取消。\n同样，出于“某些”考虑，防卫科也能叫停正在进行的项目。\n在莱茵生命的时候，总发生类似的事情。小职员们只能把设备装了拆，拆了装，调试又调试。\n还不如自己搞点研究呢，我是这样想的。\n所以我捣鼓出了个捣蛋鬼闹钟。它会在设定好的时段里，在工作室搞点小破坏，虽然不严重但又必须要我马上赶回来处理的那种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是咪波的雏形。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后来我把它们改造成了更实用的操纵机械。“咪波”也是加上开机提示音时取的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，所以梅尔每次都开开心心地回来收拾乱糟糟的房间？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀哈哈。那段时间，虽说在总部参与的项目并没有取得什么实质性的进展，但我自己研发了不少小东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后来给赫默帮忙的时候，有些装置得到她的推荐，在莱茵生命一直应用至今呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波是梅尔最喜欢的作品吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯啊，我一直希望它们成为最厉害的智能机械。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟从莱茵生命到罗德岛，这些家伙一直都陪着我，它们是大功臣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是因为报废回收、版本升级......初代服役的咪波只剩下一只了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波SUPER......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是在仅剩的这只初代机的基础上完成的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"想让机械达到人工智能的高度，哪儿有那么简单。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"不要失落啊梅尔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"梅尔梅尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"从智能的角度来说，咪波SUPER虽然没有成功，但是也不算完全失败哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用安慰我啦，可露希尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"你看这些！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——咪波的铭牌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。咪波SUPER的肢体组件都已经被重物压得碎裂变形了，它身上的铭牌虽然全部掉落......可是却完好无损欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"铭牌的材质总不会有咪波组件本身坚固吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇！你是说，它在受到冲击前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"可能只是巧合，也可能，是“本能”啊什么的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波SUPER......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波SUPER","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"语音模块严重损毁，它已经没办法回答什么了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g9_headquarter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干得漂亮！你没看见我请假走的时候那些家伙的表情哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过下次得把你放得远一些才行，弄倒椅子就行了，破坏了实验器材总归还是要花时间修复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不是该给你取个名字啊......这样吧，待会儿给你随机设置个开机提示音，提示音什么样你就叫什么名字！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波，过来，我要重新设定下你爆破程序的参数。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波，帮我调整一下机械臂的位置。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波，帮我把那个热能装置搬过来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波......欸，你怎么知道我要用这个校准仪哈哈，谢谢啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇，咪波你要干什么！别拽我啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是先干一会活，不会忘记吃饭的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波","speakerId":"avg_npc_545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好我知道了，我吃，现在就吃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"所以说，虽然比小车们差了一些，但咪波SUPER还是进步了很多的。梅尔不要放弃哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可以再给我批两个月的假期吗？！可露希尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想趁热打铁，在咪波SUPER的基础上进行第二次智能升级！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"不可以！拉着我撒娇也不可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经耽误了三个月，工程部那边有不少工作委托需要处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"还有关于咪波SUPER此次试验的全过程，尤其是意外事故部分，需要提交详实的书面报告才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"最重要的，鲁特拉工作室的维修费用，需要梅尔自己出！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"《咪波SUPER试验日志09》\n本次咪波升级失败。\n......\n但不管怎样，咪波依然还在梅尔身边，他们还拥有无限可能。\n梅尔相信咪波。\n梅尔相信梅尔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_007_closre","aliases":["可露希尔"]}]}
